-gray-300 mb-6 sm:mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n                We create stunning digital experiences that captivate your audience and drive meaningful results for your business growth and success.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTA Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4 justify-center\">\n                <button class=\"px-6 sm:px-8 py-3 sm:py-4 bg-white text-black text-base sm:text-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\">\n                    Start Your Project\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"px-6 sm:px-8 py-3 sm:py-4 bg-transparent text-white border border-white text-base sm:text-lg font-medium hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\">\n                    View Case Studies\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Stats -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6 mt-8 sm:mt-12 pt-6 sm:pt-8 border-t border-gray-600\">\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-1\">99%</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs sm:text-sm\">Client Satisfaction</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-1\">24/7</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs sm:text-sm\">Support</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-1\">5x</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs sm:text-sm\">ROI Average</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Scroll Indicator -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2\">\n            <div class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center text-gray-400\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm mb-2\">Scroll to explore</span>\n                <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 sm:w-5 sm:h-5 animate-bounce\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3\"></path>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</body>\n</html>"
